menu "Output Image"

config DS_OUTPUT_NAME_CUSTOM
	string "Add custom string to output name"
	default ""
	help
	  Append a custom string in the output artifact filenames. The string
	  will appear just after the platform type, before the distribution
	  and release names.

	  See the main README.md for more detail on how the artifact name strings
	  are built and how this option impacts them.

